WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.312
Your day is sinking and you don’t even know

00:00:03.312 --> 00:00:05.520
these 3 secrets save your time.

00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:08.840
First secret: the moment you wake up,

00:00:08.840 --> 00:00:11.660
write all your tasks on a list.

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:16.324
Second secret: if a task takes under 2 minutes,

00:00:16.324 --> 00:00:19.100
do it now — never postpone it.

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:23.611
Third secret: list the things that drain your energy

00:00:23.611 --> 00:00:25.840
— then stay away from them.

00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:29.389
Saving time matters as much as doing the work.

00:00:29.389 --> 00:00:32.820
Which secret will you try? Write it in the comments.

